{"nodes": [{"id": "clasa_a_v_a_5_ghid_repere_metodologice", "label": "Capitolul II: Repere metodologice", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "Clasa a V-a/5. Ghid.pdf", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "clasa_a_v_a_5_ghid_prezentare_manualului", "label": "II.1. Prezentarea manualului", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "Clasa a V-a/5. Ghid.pdf", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "clasa_a_v_a_5_ghid_sugestii_evaluare", "label": "II.2. Sugestii privind evaluarea", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "Clasa a V-a/5. Ghid.pdf", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "clasa_a_v_a_5_ghid_proiectarea_unitatilor", "label": "II.4. Proiectarea unit\u0103\u021bilor de \u00eenv\u0103\u021bare", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "Clasa a V-a/5. Ghid.pdf", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "clasa_a_v_a_5_ghid_model_imersie_structurare_aplicare_transfer", "label": "Modelul Imersie - Structurare - Aplicare - Transfer (Singer & Moscovici, 2008)", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Ciclul de predare-\u00eenv\u0103\u021bare din manualul clasei a V-a: imersia reactiveaz\u0103 achizi\u021biile anterioare ale elevilor \u0219i deschide explorarea temei; structurarea \u00eei ghideaz\u0103 spre sintetizarea \u0219i conceptualizarea observa\u021biilor, cu sprijin terminologic din partea profesorului; aplicarea transfer\u0103 achizi\u021biile \u00een contexte noi, prin exersare, evaluare \u0219i reflec\u021bie. Model nou, specific ghidului clasei a V-a (edi\u021bia 2025), f\u0103r\u0103 corespondent identic \u00een ghidurile claselor VI-VIII deja extrase.", "source_file": "Clasa a V-a/5. Ghid.pdf", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "clasa_a_v_a_5_ghid_model_ere", "label": "Modelul g\u00e2ndirii critice: Evocare - Constituirea sensului - Reflec\u021bie", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Model citat (Steele, Meredith, Temple, 1998), text identic cu ghidurile claselor VI, VII \u0219i VIII: trei etape (evocare/actualizare, constituirea sensului, reflec\u021bie) care preiau rubricile manualului, ca elevii s\u0103 con\u0219tientizeze propriul parcurs de \u00eenv\u0103\u021bare.", "source_file": "Clasa a V-a/5. Ghid.pdf", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "clasa_a_v_a_5_ghid_model_eu_fac_noi_facem_tu_faci", "label": "Modelul Eu fac - noi facem - tu faci", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Model tradi\u021bional \u00een cinci pa\u0219i (deschiderea, introducerea temei noi, practic\u0103 ghidat\u0103, practic\u0103 independent\u0103, \u00eenchiderea), text identic cu ghidurile claselor VI, VII \u0219i VIII: echilibreaz\u0103 rolul de expert al profesorului cu exersarea ghidat\u0103 \u0219i apoi autonom\u0103 a elevilor.", "source_file": "Clasa a V-a/5. Ghid.pdf", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "clasa_a_v_a_5_ghid_observarea_sistematica", "label": "Observarea sistematic\u0103 a activit\u0103\u021bii \u0219i comportamentului elevilor", "file_type": "concept", "definition": "Observarea sistematic\u0103 a activit\u0103\u021bii \u0219i comportamentului elevilor este o metod\u0103 de evaluare care ofer\u0103 profesorului informa\u021bii importante despre evolu\u021bia fiec\u0103rui elev din perspectiva modului \u00een care reac\u021bioneaz\u0103 la sarcinile de lucru \u0219i \u00een care se comport\u0103 \u00een clas\u0103, dar \u0219i din perspectiva competen\u021belor pe care le are.", "source_file": "Clasa a V-a/5. Ghid.pdf", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "clasa_a_v_a_5_ghid_portofoliul", "label": "Portofoliul", "file_type": "concept", "definition": "Portofoliul este un instrument complementar de evaluare, fiind alc\u0103tuit din lucr\u0103ri ale elevilor prin care se probeaz\u0103 activitatea \u0219i progresul lor \u00eentr-o anumit\u0103 perioad\u0103. Portofoliul se concretizeaz\u0103 \u00eentr-o map\u0103/un dosar/un biblioraft/o cutie \u00een care se pun aceste lucr\u0103ri ce trebuie p\u0103strate \u00eentr-un loc accesibil.", "source_file": "Clasa a V-a/5. Ghid.pdf", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "clasa_a_v_a_5_ghid_repere_metodologice", "target": "clasa_a_v_a_5_ghid_prezentare_manualului", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Clasa a V-a/5. Ghid.pdf", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "clasa_a_v_a_5_ghid_repere_metodologice", "target": "clasa_a_v_a_5_ghid_sugestii_evaluare", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Clasa a V-a/5. Ghid.pdf", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "clasa_a_v_a_5_ghid_repere_metodologice", "target": "clasa_a_v_a_5_ghid_model_imersie_structurare_aplicare_transfer", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Clasa a V-a/5. Ghid.pdf", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "clasa_a_v_a_5_ghid_repere_metodologice", "target": "clasa_a_v_a_5_ghid_model_ere", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Clasa a V-a/5. Ghid.pdf", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "clasa_a_v_a_5_ghid_repere_metodologice", "target": "clasa_a_v_a_5_ghid_model_eu_fac_noi_facem_tu_faci", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Clasa a V-a/5. Ghid.pdf", "sourc